dataset_schema:
Output keys: {queries, confidence, reasoning}
input_keys: query, transcript_section, max_rewrites
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/retrieval/query_rewriter.json

Output keys: {primary_concept, sub_queries, confidence, reasoning}
input_keys: query, max_sub_queries, source_count
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/retrieval/query_decomposer.json

Output keys: {key_terms, focused_query, max_chunks}
input_keys: query, conversation_section
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/retrieval/scope_narrower.json

Output keys: {passes_policy, violations, corrected_answer}
input_keys: user_request, draft_answer
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/generation/chat_policy_block.json

evaluator_schema:
Exact set: {response: str}
input: message (optional chat_rolling_summary, conversation_transcript)
Source: evals/datasets/final_Evalutors/direct_chat_evaluators.py

Exact set: {summary_markdown: str}
input: old_conversation
Source: evals/datasets/final_Evalutors/chat_summarizer_evaluators.py

production_schema:
LLM returns markdown text stored as 'summary' inside {summarized_history, summary, original_count, new_count, was_summarized}
inputs: old_conversation plus previous_summary and new_turns (incremental mode)
Source: packages/core/memory/chat_summarizer.py

evaluator_schema:
Exact set: {corrected_answer: str}
inputs: answer, context, unsupported_sentences
Source: evals/datasets/final_Evalutors/hallucination_guard_retry_evaluators.py

dataset_schema:
Output keys: {corrected_answer}
input_keys: answer, context, unsupported_sentences
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/generation/hallucination_guard_retry.json

evaluator_schema:
Exactly one of {json_output, markdown_output}
inputs: context, task_instruction
Source: evals/datasets/final_Evalutors/studio_system_json_evaluators.py

dataset_schema:
Output keys: {json_output, markdown_output}
input_keys: context, task_instruction
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/studio/studio_system_json.json

evaluator_schema:
Exact set: {quiz_json: {title, questions[]}}
question: {question, options (exactly 4, correct_answer must be in options), correct_answer, explanation}
Source: evals/datasets/final_Evalutors/studio_quiz_evaluators.py

dataset_schema:
Output keys: {quiz_json}
input_keys: context, custom_instructions
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/studio/studio_quiz.json

evaluator_schema:
Exact set: {flashcards_json: {title, cards[]}}
card: {front, back, optional type, optional source_hint}
Source: evals/datasets/final_Evalutors/studio_flashcards_evaluators.py

dataset_schema:
Output keys: {flashcards_json}
input_keys: context, selected_source_count
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/studio/studio_flashcards.json

Output keys: {mind_map_markdown}
input_keys: context, selected_source_count
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/studio/studio_mind_map.json

evaluator_schema:
Exact set: {output: str}
input task_type enum: quiz, flashcards, mind_map, slide_deck
Source: evals/datasets/final_Evalutors/studio_fallback_legacy_evaluators.py

dataset_schema:
Output keys: {output}
input_keys: task_type, context
Source: evals/datasets/prompt_tiered/studio/studio_fallback_legacy.json

production_schema:
Raw generated string (JSON object/array or Markdown per task_type), not wrapped under {output}
same task types
Source: packages/core/services/studio_service.py / fallback_task_prompt.j2

evaluator_schema:
Trace object: {final_route, agents_invoked, agents_bypassed, route_events, flags, agent_inputs, agent_outputs, map_reduce_ok, template_missing, error}
final_route enum: cache_hit, moderation_block, security_block, direct_chat, standard_rag, rag, whole_file_map_reduce_success, whole_file_map_reduce_fallback, studio, problem_solver, problem_solver_followup, tutor_bootstrap, tutor_followup, source_question_extraction, ingestion, ocr, refusal
Source: evals/datasets/final_Evalutors/orchestration_flow_evaluators.py
